B.LB=s(["Place one knee and the same-side hand on a flat bench, with the other foot firm on the floor.","Hold a dumbbell in the free hand and let that arm hang straight below your shoulder.","Make your back long and keep both hip bones facing the floor.","Pull your elbow toward your back pocket, pause, then lower until the arm is long."],t.s)
